      "content": "i dont know if i want to rebel against the void. it just feels like i'm fighting a losing battle. if the end result is always the same—nothingness—then why do we have to go through all the suffering just to get there? it seems almost more logical to just accept the void now than to keep dragging this around. it feels less like a rebellion and more like just... unnecessary friction.",
